  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Execution gate",
      "items": [
        "Server API gates role, assignee/owner, state, required files and the selected edge condition; a visible button is not authorization.",
        "READY / WAITING / LOCKED are computed runtime projections; they are not claimed as one exhaustive persisted status enum.",
        "A generated DOCX is a draft until reviewed, confirmed by an operator and attached to the matching dossier requirement."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Return and termination",
      "items": [
        "Return requires a reason and an earlier ancestor target. Descendants become STALE; reactivation increments the cycle.",
        "PARALLEL_JOIN uses the snapshot rule ALL, ANY or QUORUM; branches have no implicit global ordering.",
        "This workflow END precedes the separate approval, issue, delivery and archive sequence in map 19.",
        "Dossier status values ON_HOLD, REJECTED and CANCELLED are separate from workflow node kinds and END; see the canonical PCN map for dossier-level outcomes.",
        "Approval, issue, delivery and archive are a separate issuance lifecycle documented in map 19."
      ]
    }
